<title>USA: First Pacific Networks to be delisted.</title>
<headline>First Pacific Networks to be delisted.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, CA 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific Networks Inc on Friday said the Nasdaq Stock Market notified the company that it would be delisted on March 14.</p>
</text>
